OL,3,GNEWSASwan on railway tracks disrupts
OL,4,Aservices
OL,5,
OL,6,FNot too dissimilar to a scene from the
OL,7,Ffilm Hot Fuzz, a swan has been causing
OL,8,Fdisruption for train passengers across
OL,9,Feastern England after it found its way
OL,10,Fon to a railway line.
OL,12,FLondon Liverpool Street services to and
OL,13,Ffrom Ipswich, Norwich, Colchester,
OL,14,FClacton and Southend were delayed as
OL,15,Fthe regal bird wandered the tracks at
OL,16,FHarold Wood in east London.
OL,18,FGreater Anglia posted about the
OL,19,Fdisruption at 10:45 BST and a response
OL,20,Fteam was sent to retrieve the mute swan
OL,21,Fand take it to safety.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,376,370,200,160,0,100
