OL,3,GNEWSASwan on railway tracks disrupts
OL,4,Aservices
OL,5,
OL,6,FServices returned to normal at about
OL,7,F11:30. A spokesperson for the train
OL,8,Fcompany said: "Greater Anglia and
OL,9,FNetwork Rail are sorry if your journey
OL,10,Fhas been affected by this disruption."
